      root_cause: "49aea53b93 (feat(progress): heartbeat) added self._stop = threading.Event() to run_status.py, reached from every CLI entry point through self._stop.wait(interval). Receiver typing names that call threading.Event.wait; module_io_is_enumerated matches EXACTLY, so python.yaml's threading grant does not reach the class, and one uncatalogued name sets qualifying_only=False for all 18 claims at once -- the WI-jabus shape (4d0933b10c), fourth recorded instance. Not an input change: the Successfully-installed lines of the last green run (d4e11b41, 2026-10-14 20:01 EDT) and the first red (b61a205e, 2026-10-15 05:51 EDT) are identical (tree-sitter 0.25.2, language-pack 0.13.0)."  # 6b6d
